 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Booking and asking",
     "texto": [
      "**Забронировать** (to book) takes its object in the accusative: **забронировать номер** («to book a room»). With **хотел бы** («I would like»): **Я хотел бы забронировать номер** («I would like to book a room»).",
      "**На двоих** means «for two»: **номер на двоих** («room for two»). For three: **на троих**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "View and price",
     "texto": [
      "**С видом на** + accusative means «with a view of»: **с видом на море** («with a sea view»). To ask what time a flight leaves, say **Во сколько вылет?** («What time does the flight leave?»).",
      "**Сколько стоит ночь?** («How much does the night cost?») is the most common question at the hotel."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
